<title>USA: SEQUUS files to start tumor drug trials.</title>
<headline>SEQUUS files to start tumor drug trials.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>SEQUUS Pharmaceuticals Inc said on Tuesday it filed an investigational new drug application with the U.S. Food and Drug Administration for clinical testing of its SPI-77 treatment for solid tumors.</p>
<p>SPI-77 is SEQUUS's liposome formulation of the widely used anticancer drug cisplatin.</p>
<p>By filing an investigational new drug application a company seeks permission to start to test a drug on humans.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610</p>
